MODIFICATIONS

As required by Section 4(b) of the License: files in this repository have been
modified from their original form. The changes are substantial and ongoing, and
include but are not limited to:

  * A local voice stack — speech recognition, synthesis, voice cloning, wake-word
    listening, push-to-talk, spoken summaries and an on-screen caption window.
  * Discovery and use of locally installed models.
  * A new product identity: name, icons, themes, protocol handler, data directory,
    executable names, application id and installer.
  * Vendoring the backend and agent SDK into this repository so they are built
    from source here rather than downloaded as third-party release artifacts.
  * Update checks and downloads served from this project's own repository.

A complete, per-commit record of every modification is in the Git history at
https://github.com/zaorenn/The-Fool-Cli and summarised in CHANGELOG.md.

